         last, in body-tree order (MuJoCo's own qpos ordering, unrelated to and different
         from /joint_states' topic ordering, which sorts alphabetically and puts the
         fingers FIRST — confirmed live). 0.04 each = fully open, a safer default starting
         state for a future grasp demo than closed.
         ctrl: 7 arm values (unchanged, 0 ctrl on a motor actuator is 0 torque — holding
         "home" against gravity is pinn_controller_node's _publish_safe_fallback's job, not
         this keyframe's) + 1 new value for the finger's <position> actuator, matching its
         qpos so it doesn't snap on startup. -->
    <key name="home" qpos="0 0 0 -1.57079 0 1.57079 -0.7853 0.04 0.04" ctrl="0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0.04"/>
  </keyframe>
</mujoco>
